illustrations and introduction video.

The Work is protected under the Law on Intellectual Property of Vietnam and
the international treaties to which Vietnam is a party.

2. What is permitted

The repository is public on GitHub only so that others may view and read
it, and carry out the actions the GitHub Terms of Service allow on the
